flowchart TD
    Start([Decision: What to study?]) --> Rec{Dashboard Recommendation}
    Rec -- "New Topic" --> Learn[Start Learning Session]
    Rec -- "Due Review" --> Review[Start Review Session]
    
    Learn --> Content[Consume Content & Flashcards]
    Content --> DoneLearn[Complete Learning]
    DoneLearn --> SM2_Initial[Set SM-2 State: Interval=1]
    SM2_Initial --> Unlock[Run Unlocking Engine]
    Unlock --> Dashboard[Back to Dashboard]
    
    Review --> Rating[Submit Quality Rating 0-5]
    Rating --> SM2_Calc[Calculate SM-2: New Interval/Ease]
    SM2_Calc --> Mastered{Mastered?}
    Mastered -- Yes --> MarkMastered[Set Status: Mastered]
    Mastered -- No --> SetReview[Set Status: Reviewing]
    
    MarkMastered --> Unlock
    SetReview --> Dashboard
